---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Privacy Policy | Unicode To Non-Unicode Converter"
	description="Read our Privacy Policy. UnicodeToNonUnicode.com processes 100% of text locally in your browser. We do not collect, store, or transmit your text data."
	keywords="privacy policy unicode to non unicode, data privacy indic font converter, local browser text processing"
>
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 py-4 sm:py-8">
		<!-- Page Header -->
		<div class="border-b border-[var(--hairline)] pb-6 space-y-3">
			<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono bg-[var(--canvas-soft-2)] border border-[var(--hairline)] text-[var(--ink-secondary)] font-semibold inline-block uppercase tracking-wider">
				Legal Documentation
			</span>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--ink)]">
				Privacy Policy
			</h1>
			<p class="text-sm text-[var(--ink-secondary)]">
				Last Updated: August 12, 2026
			</p>
		</div>

		<!-- Main Policy Body -->
		<div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-[var(--ink-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
			<!-- Section 1 -->
			<div class="bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">1. Client-Side Processing Guarantee</h2>
				<p>
					At <strong>UnicodeToNonUnicode.com</strong>, privacy is fundamentally built into our software architecture. All text conversions (including Telugu Anu 6/7, Hindi Kruti Dev, Tamil Bamini, and Malayalam Revathi) execute entirely within your client web browser using JavaScript.
				</p>
				<p>
					<strong>No text pasted into or generated by this website is ever transmitted, uploaded, recorded, saved, or logged to any external server.</strong>
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 2 -->
			<div class="bg-[var(--canvas)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">2. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
					<li>We do <strong>NOT</strong> collect or log your pasted text input or converted text output.</li>
					<li>We do <strong>NOT</strong> require user registration, account creation, or login credentials.</li>
					<li>We do <strong>NOT</strong> collect personal identification information (such as names, addresses, or phone numbers).</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 3 -->
			<div class="bg-[var(--canvas)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">3. Local Storage & Cookies</h2>
				<p>
					We use standard browser <code>localStorage</code> solely to save your local UI preferences (such as light/dark mode selection, text font size preferences, and recent local conversion history). This data remains 100% stored on your device and can be cleared at any time via your browser settings or the "Clear History" button.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 4 -->
			<div class="bg-[var(--canvas)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">4. Third-Party Services & Analytics</h2>
				<p>
					We may use privacy-preserving website performance analytics (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics or Google Analytics) to aggregate anonymous metrics such as pageviews and browser types. No personal data or user text content is ever included in analytics logs.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Section 5 -->
			<div class="bg-[var(--canvas-soft)] border border-[var(--hairline)] rounded-xl p-6 space-y-3">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">5. Contact Us Regarding Privacy</h2>
				<p>
					If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out to us via our <a href="/contact" class="underline text-[var(--ink)] font-semibold">Contact Page</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
